<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Rakesh Sood said Friday he raised his rating on Motorola Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said he's reviewing his earnings estimates for  possible increases.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Motorola shares at mid-morning were up 3-1/8 at 67-1/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
